{"conversation_id":"d116e873-522b-4c6c-87b6-a054e750d57c","status":"SUCCESS","response":"I have created an SVG illustration of a cozy morning kitchen and saved it to [cozy_kitchen.svg](file:///tmp/vellery-fmm6zj5b/work/cozy_kitchen.svg).\n\n### Scene Highlights\n- **Morning Sunlight \u0026 View**: Golden-hour sunbeams and sparkling dust motes stream through an arched cottage window overlooking misty sunrise hills, flanked by linen curtains and potted windowsill herbs (basil, rosemary, and trailing vines).\n- **Warm Kitchen Details**: Sage-green shaker cabinets with brass hardware, a thick oak butcher-block countertop, a fluted porcelain farmhouse sink, a vintage cream stove with a steaming red enamel kettle, a copper range hood with hanging cookware, floating shelves with mason jars and cookbooks, a wall clock at **7:30 AM**, and a retro cream refrigerator.\n- **Cozy Breakfast Nook**: A wooden farmhouse table set with a sunflower pitcher, a stack of golden pancakes with berries and syrup, flaky croissants, a pour-over coffee carafe with two steaming mugs, and a sleeping ginger tabby cat curled up on the sunlit woven rug.\n\n```svg\n\u003csvg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 850\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\"\u003e\n  \u003cdefs\u003e\n    \u003c!-- Wall \u0026 Room Gradients --\u003e\n    \u003clinearGradient id=\"wallGrad\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"\u003e\n      \u003cstop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#F7EAD9\"/\u003e\n      \u003cstop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#FDECDA\"/\u003e\n      \u003cstop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#EED5B7\"/\u003e\n    \u003c/linearGradient\u003e\n\n    \u003clinearGradient id=\"floorGrad\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"0%\" y2=\"100%\"\u003e\n      \u003cstop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#C88D55\"/\u003e\n      \u003cstop offset=\"40%\" stop-color=\"#B77A42\"/\u003e\n      \u003cstop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#8F5828\"/\u003e\n    \u003c/linearGradient\u003e\n\n    \u003c!-- Morning Sky Through Wind